{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 158,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4c213525722706bcb436220",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "帮助『U-TAS』的开发，机械完成时，\\n根据期间内的成功・失败次数获得相应的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "78dc790f0f827fab9e9a57129309c6aff31d2c4a7c0ade459d79614ae91e55e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919fbdb11c7fb6264cc7286d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在复苏的故乡作为舞台的决战中，为了开拓大家的未来\\n怀揣着对船桥的热爱，展现出坚定不移的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e62580ea23ec48c0978b893d285f9ab37848d6abe0a6c6cf8b56ef5b3c7e0c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a53a6bd5b0d13428817ff42a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与状态不佳抗争的日子持续着\\n就算参加比赛也无法发挥全部实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0dea577493be20fd5394cd2cb053031d0e26c9c180ab10e5f3a2bab9ffd80e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fcf9c1864f32ad984654602",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了跨越距离的壁垒，身心还不够成熟\\n无法想象自己能够奔跑，因此在中距离比赛中无法发挥全部实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "df3ee513231d55584d4da2b9cb2f27840fc0e845af00725fad22740f857afe37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29d67b1574ce0ce45fadc957",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标伴随着困难，想要克服考验证明自己的爱！\\n因为疼痛，在比赛中无法发挥全部实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32d5b6f36830505de1e834784654c76dda35d0d16e6212cc22e278f480dcd1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905a1795616bc106480f9623",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "任凭冲动解放足以令所有人俯首称臣的末脚\\n胸怀对这一战的决意，发挥出全部实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "0343b9b5ebf2b6e8ce54403b430002b84b0ce1ede805e475bb216873c309c9ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d4842d24a8c623436cb54e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吃太多了，稍微胖了一点\\n在训练中无法提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "03894490be0806b0921d5906d16bfab115b03d169a8d104e11407c5e75aa7225",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8015a4b1e289dc85b7256aad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "英里赛是短期决战！抓不准节奏根本没法玩！好想回家……\n因动摇而脚步不稳，无法在英里赛事中发挥全力",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9e2c8e141d12a7f83983f0fce9c11f070e76f9a905b59e634588a3cdc4649b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e25f2c9bf32e589728e9053",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为偏头痛的缘故，稍微有些忧郁\\n无法提升干劲（心情）",
      "source_fingerprint": "d76a85350fb01e0ea21602b9d92974915cb5edad458a2042a4863a8fb0903606",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58cc51aa99adf8876cab4b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "且慢……注意脚下!\\n训练容易失败",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a72ab6c2492c73e008d7aa02d58a2271551b8797f785673d21c1fecdb23710",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdb4f7b18df4c7c403bba7e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "融会贯通的速度快人一步！\\n获得所有战术的折扣",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5679393dd85bf95b1b9e78e776a05356f8c059fb55b7ba41f977f1f79a63089",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84732bac62b0223ac60c75f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一起训练真开心呢！\\n与一同训练的朋友变得更加要好",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9d51503432d8c9fac0435b50ef20c459001723b70d2f54d2164e64d8fca3c13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdc2e8c6a0c09e225adfce24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "英杰！　实乃背负着学园巍然屹立之人！！\\n与记者和理事长的交流更易与评价及成长相关联",
      "source_fingerprint": "a000455d08aa2e0b49ea45790ccfc988ef69c8d7c80cfdedecca7cb8b2b71df2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "143",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be7027e7bc4ebd5ee05822f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "加了个油！\\n坚持梦想的纯洁少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "76fc838031115c4c35f8ccebc2ec74056f41e9765121fada758261c12dd191b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16645b9008bf613be2b1d2e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无声的疾驰者。\\n以音速为目标",
      "source_fingerprint": "e48beb3129f735a7d706638d6aaba15a6e84534d738d1de986157af299a9005d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753fa731b64325b518a1339a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无敌的可爱！\\n天真烂漫的活泼少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4a956ee9bc2e4dcf84d8c9ace9212736c874d070e84df3c13d4c7da1415743e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72406489890be73f931cc23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "昭和而复古的，\\n超级跑车姐姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b7f2748d7c0578c67aeb35d4fd3d6ba7252aea5d85db8efd77185c18743b8cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4869ef1aee08ba475f373adf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "护卫就交给我吧！\\n华丽又绅士的少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "506d8101dea34335764921c3b6ad4b2915f825d6f79f5cfb58f7bee5e9af886d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aad480dc5475447465a43d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出生于乡下，\\n质朴单纯的追梦者",
      "source_fingerprint": "53f17c6300a8eedcb487ea3fe677feee1a00416761850e54dc4301d7c5fa7f8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dba1a23a12703e69991283c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粗暴、奔放！\\n情绪如谜一般的黄金电波娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e366bf4a1fe099b954207e49b5ca821116cc56e17e552fc9d6078b86577ed89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a1f5a1cb4b85912fc599d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "驰骋着的青春！\\n纯情的不良Roadster",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb952e1ce7fde05cea7a596d88a2847fdb40ebd6e9f0ef2ff9e11bcc563cb57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49cfc6c5c048f03ebca7dc61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "唯我独尊！\\n不服输的傲娇少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbf269429c4da64d3ffbde480a05bc15a95bcdc33f815c410f0476f99849869",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048e4d44a3df0b305935a9b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出生于美国的\\nFriendly Girl",
      "source_fingerprint": "50721b993fbf113bfaa5c0424c5539d4f75fd1ffc0d0930ec29a7a294ce3c3ac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e0094fca6673ed64d4babb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "楚楚可怜。\\n美国海归的大和抚子",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfa1f1ab98975077147c7c4e90b5d7a72e947de60aa911a6b45bc41beec28960",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c49d8b0bfcda3bdaa034fdf6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "单挑正合我意！\\n大家信赖的大姐头宿舍长",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e90ad6a9d9c471601f37f651e382c3948bf24f9f10ab93a1baccbbc7ee6d1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2a67847544d9fd3f9e989f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "名门目白家族的至宝。\\n优雅而专一的大小姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "62a74cd683547c73d8d59047550a0f02f37588f69f0ad5a129e888a97da2e604",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4e5d2cc54427f011080f46",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "北美的怪鸟！\\n奇特又活泼的自由式摔跤手",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d841103636bf621b0e1ac378543add7347e3577996d396e04325042f5fd38e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f8903c346a0abae3e0c74d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伟大的歌剧王。\\n倾听她高昂的笑声罢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6da3472095ec418cab061f6afc2224f2c36fba6a5df6944117c9e52eb4c774",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa24e25eb7b0e8d555a22456",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多行少言！\\n硬派而顽固的独行者",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec640c69a487879073bd2332fc5f16fce9ab22c127b3155bbccbdfb2a2be3d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d031d5cd39cbcb2cd6398fd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "君临天下的“皇帝”\\n其权威不容动摇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61e2974f9bee001cca000222e90e12b3a8d30ff42b03f4b4d70405d931f6d203",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268fa326c8aa2c7e9c3dfe87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷酷无情的“女帝”\\n才貌双全的女强人",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b563b13df7ee229cb05f17a25bc624b3b61336db067e9c2c443ff316cd4dd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f912b85fa4587b1489d15f54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最喜欢马娘酱了！\\n超级万能的宅女",
      "source_fingerprint": "300e37818e4b5b91d831a4241afd97e19650bee3e2581c63a13a3eab026cbb44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed98598ee79258ce1797fd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的步调，我的生活。\\n像那漂游的云……",
      "source_fingerprint": "412a6b88bc4b4ea0c4ad781fb8c2628fc4f4f21af14119b18f87e8e30eb0a14d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b153f14ab2e7fa5bc2d068c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "吐槽如闪电一般\\n展现出毅力的大阪少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d4082cc5d79c08f276cfe5290d1d18743a6a31172897ed729b63eb681f6cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca1d2d4938dd3726023f0c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "创造自由奔放的回忆！\\n掌上明珠般的皇家淑女",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e9afbb99c8f2e3ecc3732c320020075d7f82844949c27b40606bec16f460f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dacd3dbf4f2e5c3086b29c19",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "热情的知性派。\\n将逻辑作为武器直面挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e4910314152e2e8864a5c4f043ab3a840fb4517fe978e1ff74c4ed4bbe0334a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0206c7f0582b8ef650ef1fa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "天真可爱的小女孩。\\n想要快点长大成人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d62eaa444196fe195d41cb76c245701ec6db067e4b3e95cc51311222dbc37b22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad557c5c71d422fbc0be1763",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "追逐着无形身影的\\n神秘少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "441c7d909d5298c4f3fc44a5b4bf558689cc770678fb70a7e7d39b33cdb62ff4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e4db746d76ee8e9640e817",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对严格遵守指示！\\n赛博格・马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "f272f2c166a55d94a685d0aa3558f7d50f612c8569d81eb68ea32ea15c89d146",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436adfa631d3f786ab3abefa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "运动让人心情舒爽！\\n闪耀的汗水也很纯净",
      "source_fingerprint": "f140d26fa7afaead7bb8ecefb6f78599d693e6b3a887e4fd0bae9f31427a2ee7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698d2b76a36d97b46fde0362",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大体格！大方！大…盘子？\\nBuono请慢用♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e73da736cf0e901448c6c2b1c020295a50647cc590916f76f5f99a4a01683f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147cb52bd7ac0142000db368",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是城市女孩！\\n乡下出身的努力家",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f36c0620b9a0a24f79e893331c0f6c5e2c5d9d78af47ee063e868b53ce88c91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58220a7746d361a81f14ee8b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不幸体质？\\n坚强生活着的不幸少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f12f9824f001d80830dabc49bd61b10855936904a9d6de2f9cd13e60f45b6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76fcbf34b1fe48015e870b65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "元气满满！\\n为家人着想的勤劳者",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ad5f511fe5e7beb018a1aafad31efe7ef1b3336142d2f65ca300ac2bb8fcb9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:986f943b0bd79e3364899189",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "禁断的疯狂科学家。\\n肉体研究即一切！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00bba2c8124f7128f9e2504ab914d85e2458d519d452dd8453b703b351247af8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f6d2a01368a86ab72498c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "背负着觉悟。\\n贯彻孤高的一等星",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e451115efe9df849d610301ca64019c1a22becdbd74e74a5d66c1d11902578d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:297794f2cff926eceddd7fad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说啥呢你！\\n自称电光火石・江户之子",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d8cc5205b99df7f6bf8982a39f1f8070051b67fd8f5178d8f247b553f338e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81dc651c7ab6c4f630c0ca9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随心所欲，敢哭敢笑！\\n感情丰富的正直女孩",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acea180359605e8deb6c1b9e8d050eefc01ed387b60160ed8d194117b74aa84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31fb185b8d3992a8a03672ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "循着逻辑来吧！\\n超出常识的天才少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "844361d0c9ae0a70e2d25f13855dc625aab40e8e2154c9db70895010d9623cb9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d774fbdfd36f66c362ff8528",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一切都按照计划进行。\\n严谨耿直的少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f976800d84232202345c9e9aa7112b2edfd25515130507e3ef3553a89ffb3f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb320a4e1358ea7738f1796",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可爱的闪耀奔跑！\\n要多多爱着我哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a07728476aab07bb61689daa48598cf9027f3d4c0545b00944c268bb442af12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc2546201e70b847658d100d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "目标是公主！\\n豪爽的女强人赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "04f751db8616ec7dfdf7db0a70e52d4b02b8cb5a6ecc57305064a53a5f155556",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25618ade09f233ee4eace731",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说话粗鲁的\\n优质辣妹",
      "source_fingerprint": "137ff03536764b9c642ab1263691969ef93f86df8b3138c0b67b5cd2dfee9097",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:220a0227ce3810a4f52269c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "暴走・班长。\\n不论何时都要爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ade461d64de3d8ab6453071290dae9cca4139c80ef8bfd22a74fc56bf168318",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12ad280f698824460a3caf78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "挑战世界吧！\\n将“不可能之事”也化作珍珠的姐姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b719a23d0838ddfc89ce8cb1d6cad32fbb34c7285f5fded39a8387a74230701",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a15ecf81241ab79a2cd921",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最喜欢恶作剧！\\n敢不搭理我就咬你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f682993694c45a3148a912f34cb05b4a7f4e62d777fad6b25b46d387b6d42c5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93eb6d7250f3c0adb2e24f51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "纯粹的顽皮鬼！\\n绝对会变成魔女的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7eea7f642b759ee005fda1f0a056f3141eb35498cb2b7fd8514c44948fa46c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c715668ad6d34bf1026d12",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "用慈爱的母性治愈别人的\\n温柔姐姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bff4f0f0b49dffae75d522c6df1f1c65ea4148c975637abaa4c470f6fa348b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d7fefa43ec948b2516120db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟粉丝们的互动就交给我吧！\\n未来的顶级偶像马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42118c5e6318b8828a9cc3621becffe6b87ed7ce8cf78d761419816356d7815",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b8883f3a2ab47ad90781717",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终有一天，跻身那英雄奇谭——\\n想象力丰富的读书家",
      "source_fingerprint": "80de097cd718ed2ba25d4123296185c34d95521e0d72367f6cfde18e14fe0085",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05cc3e7f0c3a1b357b10e589",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "远未成熟的佐敦！\\n活在当下的辣妹☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "afb18abee26fd3070ca220d0a3f4a6c6325a49d140c414197475415ff8b13bdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e22d08461386ebe2f7affbc6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拼死一搏！\\n身处绝境也要赌出未来的放浪赌徒",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1b32e90ffdc21299bf8b57c0766dc0b68b6b736fbc1187f915bee8ddee9c25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad023d76b9cee1d833f16d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷酷又干练！\\n用娇小的身体赢得胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7a5e7c3eb72ea64a5fcfa5af035a0d8cb1e37590e0cfaa022ef6dc0c79dde9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21b2db10cb50b859d5c168a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "花一般绽放的笑容♪\\n善解人意的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "856075e06982b94ac9f74c97200cd76e0930e5d44de01b2b332f95a6377b27da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5791d0e4ed9a36e0fff868",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使连败，也不气馁！\\n百折不挠的少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "142ffe9283fd484c187d95e75a502c2a41b6df8fbe85323a827f445d7f0113d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ed93559a9bcab88945c6ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真刀真枪来个一决胜负！\\n热血・风纪委员长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8049a699b56716d02ef78da3aa74314754e5a351cb22bb1d7d3abce337b4453d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe23a748e721231018232e6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正义之焰熊熊燃烧！\\n热血英雄，登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25f16d03efecde911032ca15db1e620f194b5dd9b23a5b63e6a60b08a801189",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cde65fdfe7cfd0e822ec037b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Marvelous！\\n元气地、无敌地改变世界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "640d214e4bdecb06091de5db8e2e02370d5d6148fb3f5f33be65688d36e0be02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a62f51f8c77a2016420af4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "福啊，来吧！\\n热爱占卜的福运祈愿少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd154abb15b2d4f44fdd7ef4c3f0e6d41249736bdd02ca040e18661f89578a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f39700e7e803f135dcfe8379",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不受任何束缚！\\n纯朴真挚的活泼赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddf435e289fed58ed97cdc1cf1c4a7de86dfb6deea0440a193cb4f3fb290ae03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d043f63b5d5ff173fa7b40a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想变得积极向上！\\n消极的努力家",
      "source_fingerprint": "356d55d3762e945f115c54ec9a8cfd1f894d58b35addc5842ea5eb07351bd3c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d10c5dd97261346e570755",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要改变！\\n带着过去的伤痛奔跑的大小姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb7059a307cd06a1fdb27f60f68d7a4c4f1b90d3712f2fff59e5d6e101c31fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ba29aad0844a85cdb9bf0ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对期待说No, Thank You？\\n疑心重重的少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6e88e3392ddf56a07a403e15c8ce1b1938305fa396c1638d748a350d2f9ae6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75239011e9af37e472769871",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "盛气凌人的大小姐。\\n那份自尊心比天还高！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a32c75388011f95812cb98033f749b50039b461fa01f07c7407bd0b3f8e3fe5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2db4816fc228f385b8ec93ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "备受期待的璞玉。\\n今天也要大获全胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aabf51fa8cf4e0fb06d9c530d5a083364c7ebb3a946dd8596bccfc47ddcbf858",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b21a092f296b09c82b41c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "彻底管理主义。\\n兼备冷酷与热情的干练赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20f59f22e75ce8c310303409493fce33914a363a8594a1197b0b32a9ceb0612",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d2add4f63a716667e9a7a9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "放轻松吧ー。\\n值得信赖的乐观少女",
      "source_fingerprint": "98096ebd0ecb3c4443275acdd52c2fee2a707d44c75cd74284aeeb7646fd097a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0323aa1550cc13f78f9c51f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闹吧笑吧嗨起来☆\\n每天都是・派对咖！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c81c6062ff9df701f53c3da07dcd0f7fc7fc5c28eacb2695f9513d03c82401",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c9fee79b60089c1be3185c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！\\n不受极限束缚的暴走赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f4281facf01c11cad1f19dca55cdf0fc5b553cf39632769a3e9acf0655137d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82c498226e789f9af7dfe87d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "内心坚强度是钻石级别！\\n挑战厄运的大小姐",
      "source_fingerprint": "781c7ff6738b57df38f1b170774c4099583c0e8bbe7e5bf22c83bf4802ae0928",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "144",
        "1067"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
